message: "If you use this reproduction, please cite it as below, and cite the original GNN+ paper as well."
type: software
title: "Reach or size? Reproducing GNN+ and testing why RWSE helps"
authors:
  - family-names: Detroja
    given-names: Vraj
date-released: "2026-10-24"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vrajdetroja/reach-or-size"
