license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A blind reproduction of GNN+ (Luo, Shi and Wu, ICML 2025) on Peptides-func,
  Peptides-struct and ogbg-molhiv with GCN+ and GatedGCN+, and a preregistered
  test of why random-walk structural encodings (RWSE) help.
keywords:
  - graph neural networks
  - reproducibility
  - positional encodings
  - long-range graph benchmark
